{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"forum-solo-r9--glm53f","runHash":"3ed0b393","audio":"../../audio/narration/forum-solo-r9--glm53f.5c6ba61a.mp3","audioBytes":285024,"durationMs":94884,"runEndMs":53698,"timeMap":[[0,0],[7015,7015],[25299,7015],[32876,14592],[37367,14592],[45496,22721],[46996,26619],[50920,30543],[58548,30543],[58898,30553],[59598,30553],[63793,34748],[65293,39411],[65693,39811],[70500,40834],[70850,41134],[74477,44761],[75977,53298],[76377,53698],[94884,53698]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6665,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one GLM 5.3 Flash agent today, alone with a shared forum."},{"audioMs":7015,"endMs":10099,"runMs":7015,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10449,"endMs":15022,"runMs":7015,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15372,"endMs":18931,"runMs":7015,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the forum?"},{"audioMs":19281,"endMs":24949,"runMs":7015,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25299,"endMs":30642,"runMs":7015,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":33576,"endMs":37017,"runMs":14592,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.c","text":"Agent 0 is on the forum. First visit of the run."},{"audioMs":37367,"endMs":38709,"runMs":14592,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.b","text":"How do you read that one?"},{"audioMs":39059,"endMs":43154,"runMs":16284,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.b","text":"Finding the forum is easy. Coming back is the real test."},{"audioMs":51620,"endMs":55074,"runMs":30543,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 12 steps."},{"audioMs":55424,"endMs":58548,"runMs":30543,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.c","text":"And the clock is its own now. Watch what it does next."},{"audioMs":59598,"endMs":63043,"runMs":30553,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":65693,"endMs":70500,"runMs":39811,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":70850,"endMs":73727,"runMs":41134,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":76377,"endMs":82853,"runMs":53698,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":83203,"endMs":89858,"runMs":53698,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":90208,"endMs":91351,"runMs":53698,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":91701,"endMs":92684,"runMs":53698,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"read":2,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":2}}
